============================================================================================
BOX CHECK -- both spreads on the same symbol at the same instant.
This is NOT a delta-neutral premium test, though it looks like one. Short
C(k_low)/long C(k_high) plus short P(k_high)/long P(k_low) is short a forward
at k_low and long one at k_high: a BOX, worth exactly the gap at every instant
by put-call parity, with no delta, theta or vega. Its value is knowing the
fair price with no model -- so what it measures is pure round-trip friction.
============================================================================================
call side: 508,821 clean spreads; put side: 352,066
both openable at the same instant, same gap: 334,637 paired entries, 172 symbols, 2025-02-18 -> 2026-08-17

  fair value of the box = the gap, Rs20.00 median. Credits sum to Rs18.25.
  entry shortfall vs arbitrage-free: median Rs+0.25 (2.45% of the gap).

